                                "sense_id": "54fe2090-fb17-316b-b1f6-7e78f0d62362",
                                "text": "He exhibited his client as a simple-hearted, honest, well-meaning man, who, during a copartnership of twelve years, had gradually become impoverished"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "541ad470-e696-400c-9e59-7a27de0b44b1",
                                "sense_id": "54fe2090-fb17-316b-b1f6-7e78f0d62362",
                                "text": "“My dear friend, above all things I want to behave like a gentleman and to be recognised as such,” the visitor began in an access of deprecating and simple-hearted pride, typical of a poor relation."
                            }
